  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### Additions\n- Added `VersionParseExtensions` with span-based parsing (migrated from DotExtensions)\n- Wired `CliRun.UseFilePathResolver` with lazy default and lock\n\n#### Modifications\n- Updated Polyfill from 10.11.2 to 11.0.1\n- Reworked `VersionParseExtensions` to use `ReadOnlySpan<char>`-based parsing instead of `StringSegment`/`StringTokenizer`\n- Migrated library constructors to construct local `FilePathResolver` instances\n- Migrated benchmark files off `FilePathResolver.Shared`\n- Renamed `ProcessConfigurationWrapper` to `BuilderProcessConfiguration`\n- Fixed `InvalidOperationException` on fast-exiting processes in `ProcessWrapper.Start()`\n- Fixed test runner hang by tightening process disposal and adding job timeout\n- Escalated cref warnings as errors in `Directory.Build.props`\n- Added remarks block to `BuilderProcessConfiguration` class\n\n#### Removals\n- Removed `FilePathResolver.Shared` singleton",
